  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0207.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Este mi&eacute;rcoles ha repetido en la III Semana Cultural de Onda la proyecci&oacute;n de la pel&iacute;cula &iexcl;Rompe Ralph!, aunque esta vez en el sal&oacute;n de actos del colegio Virgen del Carmen.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0225.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La Cassola ha acogido el recital de poemas &#39;In&eacute;ditos&#39; de Javi Aguilella, acompa&ntilde;ado musicalmente por Luis Mu&ntilde;oz y H&eacute;ctor Madue&ntilde;o.</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diecresvespradasetmanaculturalonda14/img_0185.jpg\" alt=\"img_0185\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diecresvespradasetmanaculturalonda14/img_0186.jpg\" alt=\"img_0186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diecresvespradasetmanaculturalonda14/img_0187.jpg\" alt=\"img_0187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diecresvespradasetmanaculturalonda14/img_0188.jpg\" alt=\"img_0188\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/diecresvespradasetmanaculturalonda14/img_0189.jpg\" alt=\"img_0189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a9